{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632355906658501269 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632355906591392405&sectionId=632355906658501269)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpLuOdAFQS_text","label":"ggpLuOdAFQS_text","default":"Make Christmas Memories Last: Personalized Gifts They'll Treasure for Years"},{"type":"html","id":"ggj7_WzqWpj_text","label":"ggj7_WzqWpj_text","default":"<p><i>\"Christmas is more than exchanging presents. It is a time for family traditions, laughter, and the memories we create with the people we love. While many gifts are enjoyed for a short time, a personalized keepsake can preserve a special moment and bring that Christmas feeling back year after year.\"</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3Qk2RS2qe_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg3Qk2RS2qe_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/94593466-9d8f-4e54-a643-4033b5f406ec.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3Qk2RS2qe_alt","label":"gg3Qk2RS2qe_alt","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg3Qk2RS2qe_title","label":"gg3Qk2RS2qe_title","default":"Memobrick Christmas Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoj6kMQlFO_text","label":"ggoj6kMQlFO_text","default":"<p>Finding the right Christmas gift can be difficult, especially when you want to give something that feels personal. Socks, gadgets, chocolates, and other traditional presents can certainly bring excitement, but meaningful gifts often have something more. They remind someone of a person, a place, or a special moment that holds a unique place in their heart.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized gift takes that idea even further. Instead of choosing something that could belong to anyone, you can create something connected to a memory that belongs specifically to your family or loved ones.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggO0n-QPjJt_text","label":"ggO0n-QPjJt_text","default":"<p>Memobrick gives you a creative way to turn a favorite photograph into a personalized brick mosaic. A family portrait, a favorite vacation photo, a picture of your children, or a memorable moment with someone special can become a keepsake that feels completely personal.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The finished mosaic is more than a photograph. It represents a memory that can be displayed in your home and enjoyed long after the Christmas decorations have been packed away.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every time your loved one sees it, they can remember the people and moments that made that Christmas special.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg7wHSQhwkT_text","label":"gg7wHSQhwkT_text","default":"A Gift the Whole Family Can Enjoy"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2OFbnpqEE_text","label":"gg2OFbnpqEE_text","default":"<p>Christmas is also about spending time together, and Memobrick can become part of that experience. Instead of simply opening a present and putting it aside, families can build their mosaic together and enjoy the process of watching their favorite photo come to life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents can build with their children, couples can create one together, or siblings can work on a family photo while sharing stories and laughter. The building experience creates another memory to add to the one captured in the finished mosaic.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggS88CS7op-_text","label":"ggS88CS7op-_text","default":"A Personalized Gift for Everyone on Your List"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKp34iCbvq_text","label":"ggKp34iCbvq_text","default":"<p>One of the best things about personalized gifts is their flexibility. You do not need to wait for a specific type of person or celebration to make one meaningful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>parents</strong>, choose a favorite family photograph that reminds them of the people they love most.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>grandparents</strong>, create a mosaic featuring their children or grandchildren.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>couples</strong>, turn a favorite vacation, wedding, anniversary, or everyday moment into a unique keepsake.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>children</strong>, choose a fun family photo or a special moment from the year.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For <strong>friends</strong>, use a photo that captures an unforgettable adventure or a moment you shared together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>No matter who is receiving the gift, the right photograph can turn a simple present into something deeply personal.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjwkHCjLew_viewMoreText","label":"ggjwkHCjLew_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjwkHCjLew_viewLessText","label":"ggjwkHCjLew_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"gg598okTGlP_text","label":"gg598okTGlP_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_S2LRifj_label","label":"ggM_S2LRifj_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_S2LRifj_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggM_S2LRifj_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out of stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_S2LRifj_unavailableLabel","label":"ggM_S2LRifj_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_S2LRifj_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggM_S2LRifj_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_S2LRifj_successMessage","label":"ggM_S2LRifj_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggM_S2LRifj_errorMessage","label":"ggM_S2LRifj_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"}],
